<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE 189-3 AT TEA VS TRANSVAAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE 189-3 AT TEA VS TRANSVAAL.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State were 189 for three at tea on the first day of the four-day Supersport Series match against Transvaal at Springbok Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Free State  189-3 (Deon Jordaan 57) against Transvaal.</p>
